SUMMARY:Deadline 17:00 CET: Creative Europe MEDIA: Audience Development and
  Film Education 2027 (up to 70 percent of costs\, EUR 7 million call)
DESCRIPTION:Closes 02 Mar 2027 at 17:00 CET.\n\nThe MEDIA Audience Developm
 ent and Film Education call (CREA-MEDIA-2027-AUDFILMEDU) funds projects th
 at build public interest in\, and knowledge of\, European films and audiov
 isual works\, including a dedicated strand for film heritage.\n\nOrganisat
 ion: Creative Europe MEDIA (European Commission / EACEA)\nLocation: EU Mem
 ber States\, EEA and countries associated to Creative Europe. For organisa
 tions established in a participating country\; single applicants or consor
 tia of at least two. Projects must reach audiences in at least 5 MEDIA cou
 ntries.\nAward: Grant of up to 70 percent of total project costs\; no fixe
 d maximum per project given in the summary. Total call budget EUR 7\,000\,
 000\, with about 15 projects expected. No application fee.\nDuration: Proj
 ects of 24 to 36 months. Call opened 30 September 2026.\n\nMore: https://e
 c.europa.eu/info/funding-tenders/opportunities/portal/screen/opportunities
 /topic-details/CREA-MEDIA-2027-AUDFILMEDU?utm_source=artificialnouveaugran
 tdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://ec.europa.eu/info/funding-tenders/opportunities/portal/screen/o
 pportunities/topic-details/CREA-MEDIA-2027-AUDFILMEDU?utm_source=artificia
 lnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:EU Member States\, EEA and countries associated to Creative Europe
 . For organisations established in a participating country\; single applic
 ants or consortia of at least two. Projects must reach audiences in at lea
 st 5 MEDIA countries.
END:VEVENT
