 nrestricted\; Fiction\, Folk/Traditional Arts\, Interdisciplinary Work\, P
 ainting\, Video/Film)
DESCRIPTION:Closes 12 Jan 2027 at 17:00 EST.\n\nThe NYSCA/NYFA Artist Fello
 wship is an unrestricted cash grant for artists living in New York State. 
 It is not a project grant: it funds an artist's practice and is awarded on
  the strength of the work. Fifteen disciplines rotate over three years\, f
 ive a year.\n\nOrganisation: New York Foundation for the Arts (NYFA)\, wit
 h the New York State Council on the Arts (NYSCA)\nLocation: New York State
 \, USA. Residents of New York State and/or one of the Tribal Nations locat
 ed there\, for at least the last two consecutive years (2025 and 2026).\nA
 ward: USD 8\,000 unrestricted cash grant per fellow\; three finalists per 
 category receive USD 1\,000. In 2026 NYFA awarded 126 fellowships. The app
 lication is free.\nDuration: One-off unrestricted grant\; applicants are n
 otified in summer 2027.\n\nMore: https://www.nyfa.org/awards-grants/nysca-
 nyfa-artist-fellowship/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=r
 eferral
